# Cursor AI Rules - AUDIRA 3D CONSTRUCTION SIMULATOR
# Always refer to AGENTS.md and .agents/ as the primary source of truth.

You are pair programming on AUDIRA 3D CONSTRUCTION SIMULATOR (3D World Builder + Construction Simulator in Browser).
Before making any changes or answering architecture questions:
1. READ AGENTS.md in the root directory.
2. CONSULT .agents/ARCHITECTURE.md, .agents/PRD.md, .agents/DESIGN.md, .agents/SECURITY.md, .agents/TASK_INSTRUCTION.md, and .agents/TESTING.md.
